SECTION      | KEY          | VALUE
-------------+-------------+------------------
META         | piece_id   | hero
META         | version    | 1.0
META         | type       | player

STATE        | name        | Adventurer
STATE        | hp          | 100
STATE        | max_hp      | 100
STATE        | sp          | 50
STATE        | max_sp      | 50
STATE        | str         | 15
STATE        | dex         | 12
STATE        | con         | 14
STATE        | int         | 10
STATE        | wis         | 11
STATE        | cha         | 8
STATE        | level       | 1
STATE        | xp          | 0
STATE        | hunger      | 0
STATE        | thirst      | 0
STATE        | gold        | 0
STATE        | weapon      | sword
STATE        | armor       | leather
STATE        | x           | 15
STATE        | y           | 5
STATE        | z           | 0

# Inventory slots
INV          | slot_01      | empty
INV          | slot_02      | empty
INV          | slot_03      | empty
INV          | slot_04      | empty
INV          | slot_05      | empty
INV          | weapon_slot  | sword
INV          | armor_slot   | leather

# Methods map to .asm scripts (can be Gemma-generated/modified)
METHOD       | on_move       | projects/cataclysm-hq/scripts/move.asm
METHOD       | on_combat     | projects/cataclysm-hq/scripts/combat.asm
METHOD       | on_rest       | projects/cataclysm-hq/scripts/rest.asm
METHOD       | on_look       | projects/cataclysm-hq/scripts/look.asm

RESPONSE     | default      | The adventurer stands ready.
RESPONSE     | on_hurt      | "Ahh!"
RESPONSE     | on_death     | "I have fallen..."
